# robots(6) translation units (curses/termcap come from libcurses.so and
# libtermlib.so).  Named by tools/ninja/manifest.json's tu_list; the main TU
# is robots.c (upstream main.c).  rob_move.c is upstream move.c (basename collides with the
# curses move.c TU).
